    "intro_narrative": "You awake in a dimly lit, high-tech bunker that was seemingly abandoned in a hurry. Screens flicker with lines of cryptic code, and heavy mechanical locks secure every possible exit. The air is stale, smelling of ozone and old paper. A voice recording plays on loop, mentioning 'The Final Truth Drive' hidden within these walls. Your only chance to uncover the secrets of this facility and find your way out is to decipher the complex web of interconnected terminals, safes, and cryptographic machines scattered throughout the room.",
